{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10370180","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10370180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1037018001:1":{"text":"森と山の境目にあるレインフォード村が腐敗の始まりらしいけど、あそこの村人はみんな村から逃げ出したそうよ。","source_cn":"据说腐化始于丛林和山脉交界的沐霖村。那里的村民都被迫从...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE879EEB055A2B398","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1037018002:1":{"text":"もし……もしイミルの計画が成功していたら、サウスロープ村もレインフォード村と同じように……","source_cn":"如果……如果伊米尔的计划没被发现，南坡村是否也会和沐霖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E53DC7D2D3F74D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1037018003:1":{"text":"みんな仕方なく村を離れ、森から逃げ出して……故郷を失ってたかも。","source_cn":"大家被迫逃出自己的村庄，逃出丛林……然后失去故乡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD02B0B233062666","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1037018004:1":{"text":"うう、想像しただけで寒気がするわ……","source_cn":"这种事情，只是想想都会让我的脊背发凉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCECCC448D2BA8A9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民柯米丽尔":{"text":"村人のカミリア","source":"村民柯米丽尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}